  #line-at(115.463pt, 290.795pt, "have been obtained through simulations (oedometric and shear) by considering only one direction")
  #line-at(38.835pt, 302.75pt, "for the loading application. However, the microstructure investigated is slightly anisotropic, induced by the extraction")
